{"id": "60706", "title": "开垦良夫有点甜", "author": "未知", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60706.htm", "intro": "啰嗦体：穿就穿了吧，女尊就女尊吧，什么？还是地痞瘪三一枚？呃，老娘忍了。\r\n入乡随俗，娶个夫郎暖被窝。要求？\r\n嗯，一点都不挑，只要长的爷们，英俊硬朗，身材均匀附带六块腹肌，会做饭洗衣带孩子就行。\r\n啊，就你了。你不愿意？老娘就霸王硬上弓了。\r\n某男暗爽，其实他是故意滴。\r\n于是右手拉弟，左手拐夫，身后再驼个老娘，努力种田奔小康。\r\n\r\n简化体：佛曰：救人一命胜造七级浮屠。\r\n于是她的出现就是为救了她的人积德了，所以，嘎嘎，你可真有福！！", "base": "files/article/html/60/60706", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "8915379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-15", "file": "8915381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "8915383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-27", "file": "8915384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-33", "file": "8915385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34-39", "file": "8915386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-45", "file": "8915388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-51", "file": "8915390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-59", "file": "8915392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-66", "file": "8915394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "67-73", "file": "8915396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-78完结", "file": "8915398.html", "available": false}]}